{
  "slug": "codeledger",
  "name": "Codeledger",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Token-level cost intelligence for Claude Code. Tracks per-project, per-agent, and per-skill usage with automatic user vs overhead cost separation. 6 MCP tools for conversational querying, real-time session tracking via hooks, session category classification, cost optimization recommendations, and a local web dashboard at localhost:4321.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands**, **4 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (2): `codeledger`, `dashboard`\n- **Hooks** (4): `SubagentStop`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SessionEnd`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `codeledger-server`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install codeledger@claude-community` from `bhvbhushan/codeledger`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 4,
    "command": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
